# architect-doc-skill — repository

Work inside this clone to edit skills, `office-tools`, or docs. To install skills into a user’s editor, follow `docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `skills/excalidraw-diagram/` | Excalidraw → PNG visual QA |
| `skills/word-document/` | DOCX architecture documents |
| `skills/powerpoint-presentation/` | PPTX → **mandatory** layout preview |
| `skills/spreadsheet-document/` | XLSX / spreadsheets; formula recalc via office-tools |
| `skills/pdf-document/` | PDF read/create/merge/forms |
| `skills/_shared/` | `architecture-document-principles.md`, `office-tools/` |
| `scripts/install_deps.sh` | `all` \| `excalidraw` \| `office` \| `office-system` \| `pdf` |
| `docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md` | Install skills in Cursor/Copilot |
| `docs/MAINTAINING-SKILLS.md` | Checklist when adding skills, steps, or deps |

Skill behavior: `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and `skills/<name>/references/`.

## Changing this repo

Do **not** update only scripts or README. When adding or changing a skill, workflow step, or dependency:

1. Follow `docs/MAINTAINING-SKILLS.md`.
2. Update **`.cursor/`** (rules and project config), `docs/AGENT-SKILL-INSTALL.md`, root `README.md`, and affected `skills/*/SKILL.md` (+ YAML `description` if completion criteria change).

Install bundle for users: copy `excalidraw-diagram`, `word-document`, `powerpoint-presentation`, `spreadsheet-document`, `pdf-document`, `_shared` as siblings.
